  "title": "The Gödelian argument is marred by errors and persuades no one",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "002a2811-8e5b-4164-9fd2-6894267b3230",
      "text": "Penrose’s statement of Gödel’s theorem is sound, but his discussion of it contains a number of errors, and the Gödelian argument does nothing to bolster an anti-computational view even for readers who already hold it.",
